    "Use EBF with HSS-G coil blocks (or better), olivine/emerald plate and helium gas to make the ECC (Engraved Crystal Chip)."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000029E.title": "Engraved Crystal Chip",
  "quest.1A0000000000029F.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare Emerald Lens to get ability to create the CPU (crystal processing unit) You may create it from Exquisite Emerald gem by Lathe. Or from 9 emeralds by compressing them to get a block, then cut it on cutting machine to get a plate and finaly process an emerald plate on lathe 512 v."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000029F.title": "Emerald Lens",
  "quest.1A000000000002A0.quest_desc": [
    "It will help you to create a Crystal Processor Unit."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002A0.title": "Advanced Precission Laser V",
  "quest.1A000000000002A1.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare in your inventory next items: 1) 16 Aluminium ingots 2) 24 Iron ingots 3) 32 Tin ingots 4) 1 Advanced Wafer These are items you need to create the spaсe station. To do it, just fly up with help of any rocket from any planet. But before you create and visit it, prepare all machines what you need to craft your first Raw Crystal Chip. It is the only one way to craft the first chip if you don't have one yet."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002A1.title": "Space Station & First RCC",
  "quest.1A000000000002A2.quest_desc": [
    "May be created by AL."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002A2.title": "Emitter (LuV)",
  "quest.1A000000000002A3.quest_desc": [
    "May be created by AL."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002A3.title": "Electric Piston (LuV)",
  "quest.1A000000000002A4.quest_desc": [
    "May be created by AL."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002A4.title": "Conveyor Module (LuV)",
  "quest.1A000000000002A5.quest_desc": [
    "You have to schreder the five tungstensteel ingots to make the 5 tungstensteel dusts then mix them with 2 molybdenum dusts, vanadium dust and chrome dust. This will give you a new dust that you mey smelt by EBF to get new alloy named HSS-G,"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002A5.title": "HSS-G Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000002A6.quest_desc": [
