  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002B6.title": "Stemcells",
  "quest.1A000000000002B7.quest_desc": [
    "You have to craft an any tier Disassembler (LV - IV) to complete this quest. Note that an IV tier Disassembler may disassemble tools and machines with 100%% efficiency. Also each new tier has more efficient and may give you a stemcells with higher chance. But if you want you may use even LV tier."
  ],
