  "quest.1A000000000002E1.title": "MV Machine Hull",
  "quest.1A000000000002E2.quest_desc": [
    "Now it's time to craft the polarizer if you don't did it early yet. This machine allow you to polarize iron rods to craft LV motors without using redstone to polarize rods handly. Also this is the only one way to polarize steel rods."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002E2.title": "Basic Polarizer",
  "quest.1A000000000002E3.quest_desc": [
    "It is a part of some MV tier machines. And, btw, it can be placed on machines or item pipes to transport items."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002E3.title": "Conveyor Module (MV)",
  "quest.1A000000000002E4.quest_desc": [
    "MV tier piston"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002E4.title": "Electric Piston (MV)",
  "quest.1A000000000002E5.quest_desc": [
    "Same as LV but can faster transfer fluids. Also it is a part of some MV tier machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002E5.title": "Electric Pump (MV)",
  "quest.1A000000000002E6.quest_desc": [
    "a ring from rubber sheet"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002E6.title": "Rubber Ring",
  "quest.1A000000000002EB.quest_desc": [
    "It has few uses. But some of them are an important part of technological chains. At least it can convert industrial biomass to fermented biomass."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002EB.title": "Basic Fermenter",
  "quest.1A000000000002EC.quest_desc": [
    "What is this and what is for? The answer is next: This is the early tier fuel that may be processed to different energy liquids and gases, witch may be the fuel source for gas turbines and combustion generators. You may get this via grinding most of plants products. Also this is the source of dirt for Forestry Farm Multiblock. Just grind bio chaff again."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002EC.title": "Bio Chaff",
  "quest.1A000000000002EE.quest_desc": [
    "To craft this tool just use flint and steel nugget. Cheap stuff to make fire if you have steel."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002EE.title": "Flint and Steel",
  "quest.1A000000000002EF.quest_desc": [
    "A part of ULV machine hull"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002EF.title": "ULV machine casings",
  "quest.1A000000000002F0.quest_desc": [
    "May be used as part of some machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F0.title": "4x Cupronickel Wire",
  "quest.1A000000000002F1.quest_desc": [
    "Can accept 128 eu/t (and two ampers). It will be convenient to use it instead of 2 (or 3) lv energy hatches for Electric Blast Furnace."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F1.title": "MV Energy Hatch",
  "quest.1A000000000002F2.quest_desc": [
    "This is multiblock machine that has a target to give you an ocean of steam. If, sure, you will feed it a lot. Btw, it is highly recomended to create the separated water source, to prevent water deficit, or it may come the explosion. Note, that it can use distilled water, and it wil use distilled water with higher priority, in case if this boiler has two hatches with common and distilled water."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F2.title": "Large Bronze Boiler",
  "quest.1A000000000002F3.quest_desc": [
    "A part of LBB (large bronze boiler)."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F3.title": "Bronze Firebox Casing",
  "quest.1A000000000002F5.quest_desc": [
    "Height to search: 10-40 NICKEL vein (Garnierite, Nickel, Cobaltite, Pentlandite). Your target is Cobaltite ore. But there is a different easy way. You may get it via washing plant. Put there crushed copper ore and you will get tiny cobalt dust as sub product."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F5.title": "Cobalt Ingot",
  "quest.1A000000000002F6.quest_desc": [
    "You can make it from bio chuff via mixer."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F6.title": "Industrial Biomass",
  "quest.1A000000000002F7.quest_desc": [
    "Use basic fermenter to convert industrial biomass to fermented biomass."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F7.title": "Fermented Biomass",
  "quest.1A000000000002F8.quest_desc": [
    "Just put bio chaff to brewery machine."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F8.title": "Biomass",
  "quest.1A000000000002F9.quest_desc": [
    "There are few ways to get it via distillery."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002F9.title": "Ethanol",
  "quest.1A000000000002FA.quest_desc": [
    "Can process bio chaff to common liquid biomass with help of water."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002FA.title": "Basic Brewery",
  "quest.1A000000000002FB.quest_desc": [
    "Can produce energy from most liquid fuel."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002FB.title": "Basic Combustion Generator",
  "quest.1A000000000002FC.quest_desc": [
    "Can produce energy from any gas fuel."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002FC.title": "Basic Gas Turbine",
  "quest.1A000000000002FD.quest_desc": [
    "Preparing to flying, spaceman!"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002FD.title": "Nasa Workbench",
  "quest.1A000000000002FE.quest_desc": [
    "You may craft this with help of assembling machine HV+ tier by diamond plate, epoxy circuit board and molten soldering alloy."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002FE.title": "Advanced Wafer",
  "quest.1A000000000002FF.quest_desc": [
    "To get the platinum wire is easy in comparison with crafting the platinum cable."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000002FF.title": "4x Platinum Cable",
  "quest.1A00000000000300.quest_desc": [
    "It is required for some recipes. Also you may use it with packager to combine small and tiny dust to get a dust with normal size. But you have to set a config \"dusts\" on it by screwdriver on crafting table."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000300.title": "Schematic",
  "quest.1A00000000000301.quest_desc": [
    "Pour to mixer Dinitrogen Tetroxide and 1,1-Dimethylhydrazine"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000301.title": "Rocket Fuel",
  "quest.1A00000000000304.quest_desc": [
    "Water + Chlorine + Mercury"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000304.title": "Hypochlorous Acid",
  "quest.1A00000000000305.quest_desc": [
    "You may get it via centrifuge by redstone or by cinnabar."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000305.title": "Mercury",
  "quest.1A00000000000306.quest_desc": [
