  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003CF.title": "Glowstone doped Wafer",
  "quest.1A000000000003D0.quest_desc": [
    "You may create this from empty mold."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D0.title": "Mold (casing)",
  "quest.1A000000000003D1.quest_desc": [
    "An alloy of copper and nickel. Can be produced by alloy smelter. You have to prepare a full stacks of §6copper§r and §bnickel§r ingots ar dusts (one per each material) to go forward."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D1.title": "Cupronickel",
  "quest.1A000000000003D2.quest_desc": [
    "Use Wiremill to make wires with maximum consuming resources efficiency."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D2.title": "2x Cupronickel Wire",
  "quest.1A000000000003D3.quest_desc": [
    "May be crafted from 6 glass blocks"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D3.title": "Glass Pane (for windows)",
  "quest.1A000000000003D5.quest_desc": [
    "Use endereye on lathe"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D5.title": "Endereye Rod",
  "quest.1A000000000003D6.quest_desc": [
    "A component that may be used as part of other machines or items."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D6.title": "Wireless Reciver",
  "quest.1A000000000003D7.quest_desc": [
    "You may get it by compressing 4 certus quartz"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D7.title": "Certus Quartz Block",
  "quest.1A000000000003D8.quest_desc": [
    "Just use a cutting saw on certus quartz block"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D8.title": "Certus Quartz Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000003D9.quest_desc": [
    "Advanced energy cell"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003D9.title": "Dense Energy Cell",
  "quest.1A000000000003DA.quest_desc": [
    "You may get it by compressing 4 nether quartz"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003DA.title": "Block of Quartz",
  "quest.1A000000000003DB.quest_desc": [
    "Just use a cutting saw on nether quartz block"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003DB.title": "Nether Quartz Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000003DC.quest_desc": [
    "It will give you ability to open your terminal in some radius of ME wireless access point"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003DC.title": "Wireless Terminal",
  "quest.1A000000000003E0.quest_desc": [
    "It is like an additional bag. You may put and take out your items to keep free place in your inventory. You have to charge it sometimes to keep it in working state. Note that there are portable cells with 2k, 8k, 32k storage value."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E0.title": "Portable Cell",
  "quest.1A000000000003E1.quest_desc": [
    "Multiblocks usually produce more than 512 eu/t. So they require at least EV dynamo hatch. Usually, but not always. You may use it for any multiblock generators, that produce less than 512 eu/t"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E1.title": "HV Dynamo hatch",
  "quest.1A000000000003E2.quest_desc": [
    "With help of arc furnace you may very fast convert common iron to wrought iron. And finally, then you may make a steel from wrought iron by blast furnace with low energy consuming and high smelting speed. §aBut now - on the low level of development§f you have only one way to get a wrought iron. Smelt an iron ingot to §biron nuggets§f by furnace. Then smelt each §biron nugget§f to get a §dwhought iron nugget§f. The third step is to smelt wrouht iron nuggets by §6steam alloy smelter§f with Mold (ingot)."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E2.title": "Wrought Iron Ingot",
  "quest.1A000000000003E3.quest_desc": [
    "Height to search: 50 - 80 COAL vein (Coal, Lignite). You have to collect 40 items in total in you inventory."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E3.title": "Coal Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000003E4.quest_desc": [
    "Put an ender pearl to macerator"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E4.title": "Enderpearl Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000003E5.quest_desc": [
    "Expensive part of some machines. Required osmium to be created from."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E5.title": "Field Generator (LV)",
  "quest.1A000000000003E7.quest_desc": [
    "with help of this machine you may create an uu-matter from uu amplifier. It require 8 amperes to work. Each next level accelerate speed and energy consuming in 2 times, but in 2 times down amperes count."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E7.title": "Basic Mass Fabricator",
  "quest.1A000000000003E8.quest_desc": [
    "You may use this machine as garbage box but with useful feature: if you waste here some useless items, it may give you in result a \"scrap\" item with a low chance. A scrap is main source of uu amplifier. Other way to use it is to craft a \"scrap box\", that may give you some interesting things. But there are an exception for some items that can't be converted to \"scrap\", such as cobblestone, sand, stone dust, glass, glass dust and etc."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E8.title": "Basic Recycler",
  "quest.1A000000000003E9.quest_desc": [
    "May by produced from most items by recycler"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003E9.title": "Scrap",
  "quest.1A000000000003EA.quest_desc": [
    "May produce uu amplifier from scrap or scrap boxes"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003EA.title": "Basic Amplifabricator",
  "quest.1A000000000003EB.quest_desc": [
    "May be produced from scrap. Use OSS to pour there liquid."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003EB.title": "UU Amplifier",
  "quest.1A000000000003EC.quest_desc": [
    "May be produced from UU amplifier by mass fabricator. Use OSS to pour there liquid."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003EC.title": "UU-Matter",
  "quest.1A000000000003F1.quest_desc": [
    "Use bender to make it from ingot"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003F1.title": "Electrical Steel Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000003F2.quest_desc": [
    "Place two of them not far between together and you will see a magic, if you stay on one and press shift while looking on other travel anchor."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003F2.title": "Travel Anchor",
  "quest.1A000000000003F4.quest_desc": [
    "Multiblock, that may pump fluids out from under bedrock space, in case if there are not void."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003F4.title": "Oil Drilling Rig",
  "quest.1A000000000003F5.quest_desc": [
    "May be crafted from steel rods by wrench"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003F5.title": "Steel Frame Box",
  "quest.1A000000000003F6.quest_desc": [
    "Same as common but may work in larger area."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003F6.title": "Oil Drilling Rig II",
  "quest.1A000000000003F7.quest_desc": [
    "Same as common but may work in huge area."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003F7.title": "Oil Drilling Rig III",
  "quest.1A000000000003F8.quest_desc": [
    "You may use this multiblock to divide oil into fractions with help of steam or hydrogen."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003F8.title": "Oil Cracking Unit",
  "quest.1A000000000003FB.quest_desc": [
    "May be created in implosion compressor from low-level sapphires or even from sapphire dust."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003FB.title": "Flawless Sapphire",
  "quest.1A000000000003FD.quest_desc": [
    "To get it, just put sticky resin to centrifuge."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003FD.title": "Glue",
  "quest.1A000000000003FE.quest_desc": [
    "May be created from gold wire and molten rubber by basic assembler."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003FE.title": "Gold Cable",
  "quest.1A000000000003FF.quest_desc": [
    "Height to search: 20 - 50 TUNGSTATE vein (Scheelite, Tungstate, Lithium). But Low-level way is to get it a Lithium dust from lepidolite ore: Height for search: 50-60 SALTS vein (Rock Salt, Salt, Lepidolite, Spodumene). These are a raw source of Sodium and Lithium. To get 2 lithium dusts, you have to crush 9 lepidolite ores and process them in a washing plant. It will give you tiny lithium dusts as by-product. Salt is needed to get sodium, use an electrolyzer. Also, in order to get lithium dust, you may process spodumene ore. In this case, to get lithium as by-product, you have to crush it, purify, then crush again and send to a centrifuge."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000003FF.title": "Lithium Dust",
  "quest.1A00000000000400.quest_desc": [
    ""
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000400.title": "4x Naquadah Alloy Wire",
  "quest.1A00000000000402.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 128 and 512 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000402.title": "Medium Voltage Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000403.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 2048 and 8192 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000403.title": "Extreme Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000404.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 8192 and 32768 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000404.title": "Insane Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000405.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 32768 and 131072 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000405.title": "Ludicrous Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000406.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 131072 and 524288 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000406.title": "ZPM Voltage Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000408.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 524288 and 2147483647 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000408.title": "Ultimate Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000409.quest_desc": [
    "Height to search: 40 - 60 - APATITE vein (Apatite, Phosphorus, Pyrochlore), 20 - 30 MANGANESE vein (Grossular, Spessartine, Pyrolusite,Tantalite). You may get a niobium dust as subproduct of Pyrochlore, Pyrolusite and Tantalite."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000409.title": "Niobium Dust",
  "quest.1A0000000000040A.quest_desc": [
    "Analog for tin cable, but with larger energy losing. Also it is a part of ULV machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000040A.title": "Lead Cable",
  "quest.1A0000000000040B.quest_desc": [
    "Analog for tin wire, but with larger energy losing."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000040B.title": "Lead Wire",
  "quest.1A0000000000040C.quest_desc": [
    "A base of all ULV machines. From it you can also create a cheapest input/output hatches/busses for your multiblock machines. But note that them will have the lowest capacity."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000040C.title": "ULV Machine Hull",
  "quest.1A0000000000040D.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 8 and 32 eu/t to both sides. By default it convert to lower voltage. To change working mode use soft mallet on it (just click RMB by placed transformer). This way perfectly works for other transformers."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000040D.title": "Ultra Low Voltage Transformer",
  "quest.1A0000000000040E.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 8 and 2048 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000040E.title": "Extreme Adjustable Transformer",
  "quest.1A0000000000040F.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 8 and 8192 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000040F.title": "Insane Adjustable Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000410.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 8 and 32768 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000410.title": "Ludicrous Adjustable Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000411.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 8 and 131072 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000411.title": "ZPM Adjustable Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000412.quest_desc": [
    "May convert voltage between 8 and 524288 eu/t to both sides."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000412.title": "UV Adjustable Transformer",
  "quest.1A00000000000414.quest_desc": [
    "May be created from common titanium rod."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000414.title": "Long Titanium Rod",
  "quest.1A00000000000416.quest_desc": [
    "Multiblock generator. Require any turbine (rotor) and optimal steam flow to work with max efficiently."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000416.title": "Large Steam Turbine",
  "quest.1A00000000000417.quest_desc": [
    "May be created on MV (or better) extruder."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000417.title": "Large Steel Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.1A00000000000418.quest_desc": [
    "May be created in precision laser engraver from wafer with help of ruby lens."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000418.title": "Integrated Logic Circuit (wafer)",
  "quest.1A00000000000419.quest_desc": [
    "Use wiremill on ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000419.title": "Naquadah Wire",
  "quest.1A0000000000041A.quest_desc": [
    "Put aluminium and magnesium dust or ingot to alloy smelter, to get magnaluim ingots"
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000041A.title": "Magnalium Ingot",
  "quest.1A0000000000041B.quest_desc": [
    "Main veins (with a lot of aluminium inside): height for search: 50-90 BAUXITE vein (Bauxite, Aluminium, Ilmenite), 10-40 SAPPHIRE vein (Almandine, Pyrope, Sapphire, Green Sapphire). As you now are on LV tier, currently you may pull aluminium as dust only from anuminium ore, supphire dust or green sapphire dust. But there are secondary veins (with a small part of aluminium inside): height for search: 50-60 SALTS vein (Rock Salt, Salt, Lepidolite, Spodumene), 5 - 30 BERILLIUM vein (Beryllium, Emerald, Thorium), 10 - 40 OLIVINE (Bentonite, Magnesite, Olivine, Glauconite). Ores, to get aluminium dust as subproduct, are: Spodumene, Almandine, Emerald, Bentonite, Glauconite."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000041B.title": "Aluminium Dust",
  "quest.1A0000000000041C.quest_desc": [
    "Use extruder or lathe to get rods."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000041C.title": "Magnalium Rod",
  "quest.1A0000000000041D.quest_desc": [
    "Use EBF to smelt it to ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000041D.title": "Blue Steel Ingot",
  "quest.1A0000000000041E.quest_desc": [
    "Use Lathe or MV (or better) Extruder to make a rod from ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000041E.title": "Blue Steel Rod",
  "quest.1A0000000000041F.quest_desc": [
    "May be created from common rods by hammer."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000041F.title": "Long Magnalium Rod",
  "quest.1A00000000000421.quest_desc": [
    "Require superheated steam to work."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000421.title": "Large HP Steam Turbine",
  "quest.1A00000000000422.quest_desc": [
    "May be used as part of some machines or standalone."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000422.title": "Large Titanium Fliud Pipe",
  "quest.1A00000000000423.quest_desc": [
    "A part of large HP steam turbine."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000423.title": "Titanium Turbine Casing",
  "quest.1A00000000000424.quest_desc": [
    "Multiblock, that may produce superheated steam from lava or hot coolant. It will be nice to use it in tandem with large HP steam turbine"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000424.title": "Large Heat Exchanger",
  "quest.1A00000000000425.quest_desc": [
    "A part of heat exchanger."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000425.title": "Titanium Pipe Casing",
  "quest.1A00000000000426.quest_desc": [
    "The most powerful energy generator in a game. It consuming plasma to generate a lot of energy."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000426.title": "Large Plasma Generator",
  "quest.1A00000000000427.quest_desc": [
    "Allow you to make pipes with size Huge"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000427.title": "Extruder Shape (Huge Pipe)",
  "quest.1A00000000000428.quest_desc": [
    "Use wiremill, than merge 4 wires to one 4x."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000428.title": "4x Kanthal Wire",
  "quest.1A00000000000429.quest_desc": [
    "A part of large plasma generator."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000429.title": "Tungstensteel Turbine Casing",
  "quest.1A0000000000042A.quest_desc": [
    "May be used as part of some machines or standalone."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000042A.title": "Huge Tungstensteel Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.1A0000000000042B.quest_desc": [
    "Better then previous (it works faster)"
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000042B.title": "Advanced Extruder II",
  "quest.1A0000000000042C.quest_desc": [
    "May be used as part of some machines or standalone."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000042C.title": "Stainless Steel Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.1A0000000000042D.quest_desc": [
    "Better and faster then previuos version."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000042D.title": "Advanced Wiremill",
  "quest.1A0000000000042F.quest_desc": [
    "You may get it by fusion reactor tier 2 from titanium and duranium."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000042F.title": "Tritanium Ingot",
  "quest.1A00000000000430.quest_desc": [
    "Use extruder or lathe to make it from ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000430.title": "Tritanium Rod",
  "quest.1A00000000000431.quest_desc": [
    "May be created from rods"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000431.title": "Tritanium Frame Box",
  "quest.1A00000000000432.quest_desc": [
    "Use extruder or lathe"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000432.title": "Osmiridium Rod",
  "quest.1A00000000000434.quest_desc": [
    "The best choice to excavate ores."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000434.title": "Ore Drilling Plant IV",
  "quest.1A00000000000435.quest_desc": [
    "Use Bending machine to make a plate"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000435.title": "Osmiridium Plate",
  "quest.1A00000000000437.quest_desc": [
    "Use alloy smelter to get a quartz glass from common glass and nether or certus quartz."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000437.title": "Quartz Glass",
  "quest.1A00000000000438.quest_desc": [
    "May be crafted from Empty Shape Plate by hammer"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000438.title": "Mold (block)",
  "quest.1A00000000000439.quest_desc": [
    "May be created with help of assembling machine from tin item casing and glass pane. It is nice stuff to complete §dfluid quests§f. To do that, you have to pour fluid to it by right mouse click with §3§f§buniversal fluid cell§f in hand on machine that contain fluid. This will pull liquid from machine to your cell."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000439.title": "Universal Fluid Cell",
  "quest.1A0000000000043B.quest_desc": [
    "May be crafter from tin plate with help of hammer"
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000043B.title": "Tin Item Casing",
  "quest.1A0000000000043C.quest_desc": [
    "Use Lathe to make an invar rod from invar ingot"
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000043C.title": "Invar Rod",
  "quest.1A0000000000043D.quest_desc": [
    "It is significantly stronger than stone pickaxe."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000043D.title": "Pickaxe (flint)",
  "quest.1A00000000000440.quest_desc": [
    "Simplest shovel. Required only wood to be created from."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000440.title": "Wooden Shovel",
  "quest.1A00000000000441.quest_desc": [
    "It is significantly stronger than wooden shovel."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000441.title": "Stone Shovel",
  "quest.1A00000000000442.quest_desc": [
    "It is significantly stronger than wooden pickaxe."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000442.title": "Stone Pickaxe",
  "quest.1A00000000000444.quest_desc": [
    "Better than common boiler, but require more coal to heat up."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000444.title": "High Pressure Coal Boliler",
  "quest.1A00000000000445.quest_desc": [
    "Nice alloy, that you may create from tin and copper. It is a main material for steam machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000445.title": "Bronze Ingot",
  "quest.1A00000000000446.quest_desc": [
    "Use saw on any wooden plank to get a wooden slab."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000446.title": "Wood Slab",
  "quest.1A00000000000447.quest_desc": [
    "May be used as a part of rails tracks. You may craft it handly with help of crafting table, but it is recommended to use a chemical bath."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000447.title": "Wooden Tie",
  "quest.1A00000000000448.quest_desc": [
    "May be used as a part of rails tracks."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000448.title": "Wooden Railbed",
  "quest.1A00000000000449.quest_desc": [
    "A part of wooden track"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000449.title": "Wooden Rail",
  "quest.1A0000000000044A.quest_desc": [
    "A part of standard track."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000044A.title": "Standard Rail",
  "quest.1A0000000000044B.quest_desc": [
    "A cheapest but slowest rails track."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000044B.title": "Wooden Track",
  "quest.1A0000000000044C.quest_desc": [
    "A common rails track."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000044C.title": "Track",
  "quest.1A0000000000044E.quest_desc": [
    "You may use it as a source of power to move you train. But don't forget to fill it up with coal and water."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000044E.title": "Steam Locomotive",
  "quest.1A0000000000044F.quest_desc": [
    "It is a nice stuff to ride it on tracks. Or you may use it to automatically transferring your resources from miner to your base (just example). But in this case you have to use one of two locomotive types to pull your train."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000044F.title": "Minecart",
  "quest.1A00000000000450.quest_desc": [
    "A part of minecart wheels"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000450.title": "Iron Ring",
  "quest.1A00000000000451.quest_desc": [
    "A part of LBB (large bronze boiler)."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000451.title": "Bronze Pipe Casing",
  "quest.1A00000000000452.quest_desc": [
    "A part of LBB (large bronze boiler)."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000452.title": "Bronze Frame Box",
  "quest.1A00000000000453.quest_desc": [
    "Just a bronze stick. It may be used as a part of some machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000453.title": "Bronze Rod",
  "quest.1A00000000000454.quest_desc": [
    "It is a HV energy storage."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000454.title": "MFE",
  "quest.1A00000000000455.quest_desc": [
    "You may put a MFE to a Minecart to get transportable energy storage. Also, later, you may pull it out with help of crafting grid."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000455.title": "MFE Cart",
  "quest.1A00000000000456.quest_desc": [
    "A part of some items or machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000456.title": "Steel Gear Box Casing",
  "quest.1A00000000000457.quest_desc": [
    "A part of Tunnel Bore"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000457.title": "Track Layer Cart",
  "quest.1A00000000000458.quest_desc": [
    "It is a part of some railcraft items or machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000458.title": "Receiver Circuit",
  "quest.1A00000000000459.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare dyes"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000459.title": "Red Yellow Lime Dyes",
  "quest.1A0000000000045A.quest_desc": [
    "It may show to spawn point. Also it may be used as a part to craft an other items"
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000045A.title": "Compas",
  "quest.1A0000000000045C.quest_desc": [
    "May be used as a cover on GT machines, to control their states by redstone signal."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000045C.title": "Machine Controller",
  "quest.1A0000000000045D.quest_desc": [
    "Amazing machine that may help you to dig wide(3 by 3 blocks) tunnels inside mounts or underground. It require tracks, gravel and coal to work. It may take that things from minecart with chest and use them while working. But note, that this machine afraid of lava and it will stop if lava source or stream appear next or in front of tunnel bore machine."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000045D.title": "Tunnel Bore",
  "quest.1A0000000000045E.quest_desc": [
    "It is required MFE cart (or cart with other energy storage) to pull it as energy source to working."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000045E.title": "Electric Locomotive",
  "quest.1A00000000000460.quest_desc": [
    "Use a mixer to make this dust from redstone coal and silicon dusts"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000460.title": "Redstone Alloy Dust",
  "quest.1A00000000000461.quest_desc": [
    "Put a dust to EBF to get an ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000461.title": "Redstone Alloy Ingot",
  "quest.1A00000000000462.quest_desc": [
    "It is a part of some railcraft items or machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000462.title": "Controller Circuit",
  "quest.1A00000000000463.quest_desc": [
    "An item that may link controller and receiver between together."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000463.title": "Signal Tuner",
  "quest.1A00000000000465.quest_desc": [
    "It may get wireless redstone signal from Signal Controller Box, that was linked with this block by signal tuner."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000465.title": "Signal Recevier Box",
  "quest.1A00000000000466.quest_desc": [
    "It may emit wireless redstone signal that may be received by Signal Receiver Box, that was linked with this block by signal tuner."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000466.title": "Signal Controller Box",
  "quest.1A00000000000467.quest_desc": [
    "It may be used as a frame of space that you want to \"cut\" from real world to place it to another place. Minimum pillars required - 2 (that placed by opposite corners). But for most efficient (by energy) usage it is recommended to use 4 , placed by conners of space that you want to cut. Pillars height should by +1 blocks of top and bottom of space to transport. Also you require to connect all pillars together by any ME cable and you should use lever or button or other redstone signal source on use spatial OI port (with spatial storage cell inside) to make spatial cutting or to it placing."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000467.title": "Spatian Pylon",
  "quest.1A00000000000468.quest_desc": [
    "A simplest component that may be used as a part of spatial storage cell or as a part of better spatial components."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000468.title": "2*3 Spatial Component",
  "quest.1A00000000000469.quest_desc": [
    "It is a \"controller\" for spatial pylons. Place it near one of them, put spatial storage cell inside, and send redstore signal to activate. In case if you have enought energy inside you ME network, process will be finished successfully. To place the cutted spatial area back to world repeat this actions with filled storage cell."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000469.title": "Spatial IO Port",
  "quest.1A0000000000046A.quest_desc": [
    "Very useful AE2 machine that allow you to unload items from ME (item or fluid) Storage Cells to your ME network."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000046A.title": "ME IO Port",
  "quest.1A0000000000046B.quest_desc": [
    "It may keep inside it a spatial with size 2 by 2 by 2 blocks."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000046B.title": "2*3 Spatial Storage Cell",
  "quest.1A0000000000046D.quest_desc": [
    "Create a nether portal. Now you can do it."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000046D.title": "Nether Portal",
  "quest.1A0000000000046F.quest_desc": [
    "Just a bucket with lava inside."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000046F.title": "Lava Bucket",
  "quest.1A00000000000470.quest_desc": [
    "Empty battery casing, that may be filled by sodium, lithium or cadmium. It was in case if you want to create an accumulator. But you may craft a single-use battery by filling to it with mercury or with sulfuric acid."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000470.title": "Large Battery Hull",
  "quest.1A00000000000474.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000474.title": "[sb] Steam Macerator",
  "quest.1A00000000000475.quest_desc": [
    "Crowbar - can be crafted from any metal rods and any blue dye + hammer and file. You may use it to pull out covers such as plates that was set on the sides of machine or pipe."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000475.title": "Crowbar",
  "quest.1A00000000000478.quest_desc": [
    "Simple sign that allow you to write some text."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000478.title": "Sign",
  "quest.1A0000000000047B.quest_desc": [
    "Building tool.  It can be used to place blocks by right-clicking on a side of the same block."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000047B.title": "Iron Wand",
  "quest.1A0000000000047C.quest_desc": [
    "Better than iron wand. Has vertical building mod."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000047C.title": "Diamond Wand",
  "quest.1A0000000000047F.quest_desc": [
    "A small item, that can be used to store, copy, and paste settings. Shift + Right Click on a configurable object to save the settings onto the memory card (a click on air will clear settings), then right click on any other block of the same type to paste the settings. They are also used to link the input P2P Tunnel to the correct output P2P Tunnels."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000047F.title": "Memory Card",
  "quest.1A00000000000481.quest_desc": [
    "Nice tool to decoration most blocks in the Minecraft. Also there are diamond and obsidian chisels, that have same functionality, but with larger durability."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000481.title": "Chisel",
  "quest.1A00000000000482.quest_desc": [
    "A part of scuba set."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000482.title": "Hazmat Suit",
  "quest.1A00000000000483.quest_desc": [
    "A part of scuba set."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000483.title": "Hazmat Suit Leggings",
  "quest.1A00000000000484.quest_desc": [
    "A part of scuba set."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000484.title": "Rubber Boots",
  "quest.1A00000000000485.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000485.title": "[sb] Small Coal Boiler",
  "quest.1A00000000000487.quest_desc": [
    "Use a file or a lathe to make a rod from a brass ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000487.title": "Brass Rod",
  "quest.1A00000000000488.quest_desc": [
    "Miner may do your work instead of you it can dig a resources (ores). But it require mining pipes. You have to craft 54 of them. (other 10 will be the reward for you). In total 64 mining pipes are enough to dig all ores above bedrock. But quality of work is depends on height where you will place your miner, to give to it ability to dig all ores above bedrock. Fore example it can dig all ores on the sea level with one stack (64 items) of mining pipes inside it. Note, that you may give to miner lower (than 8 eu/t) energy to work and it will by ok (but it may works slower). Area of work is 17 block (8 blocks radius). So, when you craft miner and mining pipes,  you may place your miner anywere. Then just put mining pipes inside it, connect it with energy and enjoy. Btw, it may auto output digged ores."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000488.title": "Basic Miner",
  "quest.1A00000000000489.quest_desc": [
    "This is a present - solar panel. You may place it as a cover on a top on any machine, battery buffer or even machine hull. In the last case it may be use as \"solar energy generator\". Just turn it energy output to direction you want."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000489.title": "Solar Panel",
  "quest.1A0000000000048A.quest_desc": [
    "You may combine 8 simple solar panels to get one 8V solar panel."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000048A.title": "Solar Panel (8V)",
  "quest.1A0000000000048B.quest_desc": [
    "It is used to keep a given area of Chunks constantly loaded into memory, allowing for the game's processes to go on, regardless if a Player is present or not. A Redstone signal will deactivate the Loader. It is important to always verify the coverage of the area loaded, using the Show Lasers feature, as some machines may operate in unintended ways if not loaded properly."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000048B.title": "Chunk Loader",
  "quest.1A0000000000048C.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000048C.title": "[sb] High Pressure Macerator",
  "quest.1A0000000000048D.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000048D.title": "[sb] Basic Macerator",
  "quest.1A0000000000048E.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000048E.title": "[sb] Advanced Macerator",
  "quest.1A0000000000048F.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000048F.title": "[sb] Universal Macerator",
  "quest.1A00000000000490.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000490.title": "[sb] Universal Pulverizer",
  "quest.1A00000000000491.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000491.title": "[sb] Blend-O-Matic (IV)",
  "quest.1A00000000000492.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000492.title": "[sb] Blend-O-Matic (LuV)",
  "quest.1A00000000000493.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000493.title": "[sb] Blend-O-Matic (ZPM)",
  "quest.1A00000000000494.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000494.title": "[sb] Repurpoused Laundary Washer (ZPM)",
  "quest.1A00000000000495.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000495.title": "[sb] Blend-O-Matic (UV)",
  "quest.1A00000000000496.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000496.title": "[sb] Basic Ore Washing Plant",
  "quest.1A00000000000497.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000497.title": "[sb] Advanced Ore Washing Plant",
  "quest.1A00000000000498.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000498.title": "[sb] Advanced Ore Washing Plant II",
  "quest.1A00000000000499.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000499.title": "[sb] Advanced Ore Washing Plant III",
  "quest.1A0000000000049A.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000049A.title": "[sb] Repurpoused Laundary Washer (IV)",
  "quest.1A0000000000049B.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000049B.title": "[sb] Repurpoused Laundary Washer (LuV)",
  "quest.1A0000000000049C.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000049C.title": "[sb] Repurpoused Laundary Washer (UV)",
  "quest.1A0000000000049E.quest_desc": [
    "You may craft it from 4 clay balls."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000049E.title": "Clay (block)",
  "quest.1A0000000000049F.quest_desc": [
    "Use mortar (or macerator, if you have it) to craft a clay dust from clay block."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000049F.title": "Clay Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000004A0.quest_desc": [
    "Combine clay dust and brick dust to get fireclay dust."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A0.title": "Fireclay Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000004A1.quest_desc": [
    "Use compressor to get raw compressed fireclay bricks from fireclay dust."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A1.title": "Compressed Fireclay",
  "quest.1A000000000004A2.quest_desc": [
    "Put compressed fireclay bricks to furnace to get firebrick."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A2.title": "Firebrick",
  "quest.1A000000000004A3.quest_desc": [
    "Use forge hammer to crush bricks to brick dust. You will get 1 small brick dust per each brick. Then you may combine 4 of them, to get normal size brick dust."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A3.title": "Brick Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000004A4.quest_desc": [
    "Use a file on tin ingot to create a tin rod."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A4.title": "Tin rod",
  "quest.1A000000000004A5.quest_desc": [
    "Use a saw on tin rod to make tin bolts."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A5.title": "Tin bolt",
  "quest.1A000000000004A6.quest_desc": [
    "Use hammer on tin rod to get a tin ring."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A6.title": "Tin Ring",
  "quest.1A000000000004A7.quest_desc": [
    "You have to find any sheep (with any body color). But to get exactly a black wool you have to paint it to black (by any black dye - squid ink for example). Btw, from two sheeps you may create one more via feeding them by wheat. And if both of them where black  new one will be black too."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A7.title": "Black Wool",
  "quest.1A000000000004A9.quest_desc": [
    "You may use it to make an ingots from small or tiny piles or nuggets."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004A9.title": "Mold (Ingot)",
  "quest.1A000000000004AA.quest_desc": [
    "Use file or lathe (or MV extruder, if you have it) to make a steel rod from steel ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004AA.title": "Steel Rod",
  "quest.1A000000000004AB.quest_desc": [
    "May be crafted from two 1x Tin Wire."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004AB.title": "2x Tin Wire",
  "quest.1A000000000004AD.quest_desc": [
    "Nice machine that may do useful work for you. As an example: cut wood to planks, cut steel plate to casings, cut wool to carpet, cut rod to bolts and other else. So it may process your stuff with more efficient (in most cases)."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004AD.title": "Basic Cutting Machine",
  "quest.1A000000000004B0.quest_desc": [
    "May be crafted from steel rod by hammer."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004B0.title": "Steel Ring",
  "quest.1A000000000004B1.quest_desc": [
    "Use 3 wooden planks and 3 blocks of wool to craft a bed. It will give you ability to skip a night (if you play solo) while you sleeping."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004B1.title": "Bed",
  "quest.1A000000000004B2.quest_desc": [
    "Find and kill few sheeps to get 3 wools in total."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004B2.title": "Wool (any color)",
  "quest.1A000000000004B3.quest_desc": [
    "Use a saw on any wood planks to get wooden slabs."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004B3.title": "Wooden Slab",
  "quest.1A000000000004B5.quest_desc": [
    "Use Wire Cutter on Tin Plate"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004B5.title": "1x Tin Wire",
  "quest.1A000000000004B9.quest_desc": [
    "Use Cutting Machine to make a plate from a block."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004B9.title": "Yellow Garnet Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000004BB.quest_desc": [
    "Faster than LV, and can work with all bending recipes."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004BB.title": "Advanced Bending Machine",
  "quest.1A000000000004BC.quest_desc": [
    "May be created from silicon ingot by few ways."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004BC.title": "Silicon Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000004BD.quest_desc": [
    "You may get it from silicon dust by common furnace."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004BD.title": "Silicon Ingot",
  "quest.1A000000000004C1.quest_desc": [
    "May be created from HSS_E Ingot"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004C1.title": "HSS-E Rod",
  "quest.1A000000000004C3.quest_desc": [
    "Put it to lathe (Any tier) to get a lens."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004C3.title": "Exquisite Emerald",
  "quest.1A000000000004C4.quest_desc": [
    "Use cutting machine to make a plate from emerald block."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004C4.title": "Emerald Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000004C5.quest_desc": [
    "Compress 9 emeralds to get a block from it"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004C5.title": "Block of Emerald",
  "quest.1A000000000004C6.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare 9 emeralds. And one more requirement to went by this quest branch is to own a lathe HV tier."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004C6.title": "Nine emeralds",
  "quest.1A000000000004C7.quest_desc": [
    "May be created from hopper and paper. You may place it as upgrade to item conduit to setup items to filter on import and/or export."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004C7.title": "Basic Item Filter",
  "quest.1A000000000004C8.quest_desc": [
    "Better than basic item filter. You may set up to 10 items to filter (instead of 5 for basic item filter basic)."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004C8.title": "Advanced Item Filter",
  "quest.1A000000000004C9.quest_desc": [
    "It is a part of Cargo Loader or Unloader. Also you may use it standalone."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004C9.title": "Hopper",
  "quest.1A000000000004CA.quest_desc": [
    "It is required to make a coolant. To make it use mixer MV or better tier."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004CA.title": "MV (or better) Mixer",
  "quest.1A000000000004CF.quest_desc": [
    "Make it from wood planks."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004CF.title": "Stick",
  "quest.1A000000000004D1.quest_desc": [
    "You have to find a rare ore vien... Height to search: 20 - 50 TUNGSTATE vein (Scheelite, Tungstate, Lithium). But there is one other way to get this enough rare stuff. Any way, if you found tungstate ore vien - you are lucky!"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004D1.title": "Tungstate - the lucky way",
  "quest.1A000000000004D2.quest_desc": [
    "You may put it as a cover on pipe or input/output hatch to set a flow power. Negative numbers means that it will pump into a block on which you put it. Positive - it will pump a gas o liquid from a block on which you place it, to the side it looks to. You may set flow by clicking RMB with empty hand or by screwdriver."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004D2.title": "Fluid Regulator",
  "quest.1A000000000004D5.quest_desc": [
    "Craft any packager between LV and (including) IV tier. It may not only make covered LV wires (with help of carpet), but also combine small and tiny dusts to make from it a dust with normal size. Note, that this mode require to use a item \"schematic (Dusts)\"."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004D5.title": "Packager (LV - IV)",
  "quest.1A000000000004D6.quest_desc": [
    "Craft any super buffer between LV and (including) IV tier. It dont have visible inventory but it may keep inside it a lot of item stacks. But the main is it can push contained items in count you set. To set a count use a screwdriver. Also it require a bit of energy to work. Nice example how to use it is push a 4 small dusts or a 9 tiny dusts to packager (with chematica dusts) to combine these dusts to dust with normal size."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004D6.title": "Super Buffer (LV - IV)",
  "quest.1A000000000004D7.quest_desc": [
    "A part of fluid filter machine."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004D7.title": "Simple Fluid Filter",
  "quest.1A000000000004D8.quest_desc": [
    "A part of simple fluid filter. Also you may use it standalone as a pipe to transport fluids."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004D8.title": "Small Copper Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.1A000000000004D9.quest_desc": [
    "Used together with an ore washing plant, to get common water and a bit of by-products. Also you can just filter water without by-products. Use a programmed circuit to set the working mode."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000004D9.title": "Basic Fluid Filter",
  "quest.1A000000000004DA.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
