  "quest.1A00000000000672.title": "[sb] High Pressure Lava Boiler",
  "quest.1A00000000000673.quest_desc": [
    "Nice choose to transport a water. It is a cheapest way for fluids. But don't try to use these pipes for steam."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000673.title": "Wooden Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.1A00000000000674.quest_desc": [
    "As an other plates you may do it from 2 ingots by hammer."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000674.title": "Steel Plate",
  "quest.1A00000000000675.quest_desc": [
    "It is a small but useful multiblock, that will allow you to pump out a water from rivers without deleting water blocks while it works. Also it may work in ocean to get a salt water from it. It require a steam as a fuel to work."
  ],
