  "quest.1A00000000000685.title": "[sb] Advanced Electric Oven VII",
  "quest.1A00000000000686.quest_desc": [
    "It is a small but useful multiblock, that will allow you to pump out a water from rivers without deleting water blocks while it works. Also it may work in ocean to get a salt water from it. It require a ULV (or better) energy hatch."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000686.title": "Electric Water Pump",
  "quest.1A00000000000687.quest_desc": [
    "It is a small but useful multiblock, that will allow you to pump out a water from rivers without deleting water blocks while it works. Also it may work in ocean to get a salt water from it."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000687.title": "Advanced Electric Water Pump",
  "quest.1A00000000000688.quest_desc": [
    "It is a small but useful multiblock, that will allow you to pump out a water from rivers without deleting water blocks while it works. Also it may work in ocean to get a salt water from it."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000688.title": "Advanced Electric Water Pump II",
  "quest.1A00000000000689.quest_desc": [
    "It is a small but useful multiblock, that will allow you to pump out a water from rivers without deleting water blocks while it works. Also it may work in ocean to get a salt water from it."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000689.title": "Advanced Electric Water Pump III",
  "quest.1A0000000000068A.quest_desc": [
    "It is a small but useful multiblock, that will allow you to pump out a water from rivers without deleting water blocks while it works. Also it may work in ocean to get a salt water from it."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000068A.title": "Advanced Electric Water Pump IV",
  "quest.1A0000000000068B.quest_desc": [
    "To complete this quest you have to make any one microwave with tier between LV and IV."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000068B.title": "Microwave",
  "quest.1A0000000000068C.quest_desc": [
    "Use a hammer or a bending machine to make a plate from an lead ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000068C.title": "Lead Plate",
  "quest.1A0000000000068D.quest_desc": [
    "A part of EV Machine Hull."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000068D.title": "EV Machine Casing",
  "quest.1A0000000000068E.quest_desc": [
    "I gas you should know how to craft it at this progress level..."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000068E.title": "Titanium Plate",
  "quest.1A0000000000068F.quest_desc": [
    "This machine can work even without energy, but within a low range. By default it prevents monsters from spawning in 16 blocks range. But if you connect it to a source of energy, the range will be increased to 64 blocks. Energy consuming is 4 eu/t for LV tier, and each next tier it will be four times higher (16, 64, 256 and etc). To complete the quest, you have to craft a Repellator of LV - IV tier. A screwdriver can change the working mode."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000068F.title": "Monster Repellator",
  "quest.1A00000000000690.quest_desc": [
    "One of many single-block machines."
  ],
