  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000697.title": "[sb] Advanced Monster Repellator VII",
  "quest.1A0000000000069B.quest_desc": [
    "Use a cutting machine to get it with top efficient."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000069B.title": "Bronze Item Casing",
  "quest.1A0000000000069D.quest_desc": [
    "Cheap MV tier Battery."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000069D.title": "Medium Sodium Battery",
  "quest.1A0000000000069E.quest_desc": [
    "Good choose is to take it with you to dig an ores in mine if you have an electric drill."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000069E.title": "Adv.Batpack",
  "quest.1A0000000000069F.quest_desc": [
    "Now, when you have stainless steel, you may craft your first electric mining tool - a drill. To complete this quest you may craft any LV tier drill with any drill tip and with any lv battery (sodium/cadmium/lithium)"
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000069F.title": "Drill (LV)",
  "quest.1A000000000006A4.quest_desc": [
    "This item may allow you to view signal lines between two linked signal blocks. To activate this function you have to take this goggles to your hand and do RMB until in chat you see \"Current Aura: Signalling\". Then you may weare it to see signal lines."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006A4.title": "Trackman's Goggles",
  "quest.1A000000000006A5.quest_desc": [
    "A part of some railcraft items."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006A5.title": "Signal Circuit",
  "quest.1A000000000006A6.quest_desc": [
    "It can detect staying or moving carts or trains if you place two block signals near railroad tracks and link them together by signal block surveyor. To convert the train detection to redstone signal use a signal tuner on one of linked signal blocks and then click on signal recevier box. After this if a train that appear on railroad tracks between to linked signal blocks will activate the emiting of redstone signal from the linked signal recevier box."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006A6.title": "Block Signal",
  "quest.1A000000000006A7.quest_desc": [
    "An item, that may link two signal blocks together."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006A7.title": "Signal Block Surveyor",
  "quest.1A000000000006A8.quest_desc": [
    "Useful track for railroad that push your train or cart forward by moving direction"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006A8.title": "Booster Track",
  "quest.1A000000000006A9.quest_desc": [
    "A track that may to stop and hold a cart or a train until it get a redstone signal. It may work in few mods - for carts and for trains. Also you may set a direction to push a cart or a train on redstone signal activation. But for train it will work only if a train moving direction is the same as you set for locking track. To change a working settings use a crowbar."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006A9.title": "Locking Track",
  "quest.1A000000000006AA.quest_desc": [
    "A track that may change working status for train. It will work if you send a redstone signal to this track. To change a working settings use a crowbar."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006AA.title": "Locomotive Track",
  "quest.1A000000000006AB.quest_desc": [
    "A part of Locking Track"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006AB.title": "Pressure Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000006AC.quest_desc": [
    "You may create it from common gold wire by wiremill or from gold foil by wire cutter."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006AC.title": "Fine Gold Wire",
  "quest.1A000000000006AE.quest_desc": [
    "A part of some railcraft items."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006AE.title": "Signal Lamp",
  "quest.1A000000000006AF.quest_desc": [
    "You may use it to get a raw rubber from a sticky resin. Or to get dyes from flowers with more efficient. But it is §cstrongly recommended§r to use exactly §acentrifuge§r to produce a raw rubber, because it will give you also a glue."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006AF.title": "Steam Extractor",
  "quest.1A000000000006B0.quest_desc": [
    "Use any one of ways you know to make a plate from an ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006B0.title": "Redstone Alloy Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000006B1.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare one of blue plates, as Lapis, Lazurite, Sodalite. Use compressor to get a block and then cut it to get plates"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006B1.title": "One of Blue Plates",
  "quest.1A000000000006B2.quest_desc": [
    "You may make it from plate by bending machine or by hammer"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006B2.title": "Thin Polyethylene Sheet",
  "quest.1A000000000006B4.quest_desc": [
    "A nice portable device to scan and read a data from compact disks or data sticks."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006B4.title": "Basic Data Reader",
  "quest.1A000000000006B5.quest_desc": [
    "Simple ores and under-bedrock fluids scanner. Requires explosive to start working, and a CD or a Data Stick to read the result of work. Later, at EV tier, you will have an opportunity to craft and use an Advanced Seismic Prospector that has more better properties to scan such as larger radius. Note that this and next tier seismic prospectors are waterproof, so they can work underwater."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006B5.title": "Seismic Prospector",
  "quest.1A000000000006B6.quest_desc": [
    "You may craft it from steel plates and hammer."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006B6.title": "Steel Hull",
  "quest.1A000000000006B8.quest_desc": [
    "A part of Tin Electron Tube"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006B8.title": "Iron Bolt",
  "quest.1A000000000006BA.quest_desc": [
    "It may be useful for some recipes such as for some ender io ingots. There are many ways to get it (use NEI)"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006BA.title": "Ashes",
  "quest.1A000000000006BB.quest_desc": [
    "Use mixer to get this dust from soulsand, gold dust and ashes."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006BB.title": "Soularium Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006BC.quest_desc": [
    "Use mixer to make a dust from steel, coal and silicon dusts."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006BC.title": "Electrical Steel Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006BD.quest_desc": [
    "It is a mix of Electrical Steel, Coal and Obsidian dusts (use mixer)"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006BD.title": "Dark Steel Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006BE.quest_desc": [
    "Put a Crushed Obsidian back to macerator to get a dust."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006BE.title": "Obsidian Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006C0.quest_desc": [
    "A mix of redstone alloy, enderpearl and iron dusts (use mixer)"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006C0.title": "Pulsating Iron Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006C1.quest_desc": [
    "A mix of endereye, chrome and Energetic Alloy Dust (use a mixer)"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006C1.title": "Vibrant Alloy Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006C2.quest_desc": [
    "A mix of Conductive Iron, gold and black steel dusts (use a mixer)"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006C2.title": "Energetic Alloy Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006C3.quest_desc": [
    "A mix of Redstone Alloy, Iron and Silver dusts (use mixer)"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006C3.title": "Conductive Iron Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006C7.quest_desc": [
    "Height to search: 20 - 50 TUNGSTATE vein (Scheelite, Tungstate, Lithium). But it wil be hard to find. So you may use centrifuge MV+ tier to separate lava to get few type of resources including the small pile of tangstate dust with a tiny chance (only 2.5%% per every 100 mb)."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006C7.title": "Scheelite Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006C8.quest_desc": [
    "User wiremill to make a wire."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006C8.title": "1x Tungsten Wire",
  "quest.1A000000000006C9.quest_desc": [
    "EV tier battery buffer."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006C9.title": "MFSU",
  "quest.1A000000000006CB.quest_desc": [
    "There are few ways how to craft it."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006CB.title": "Olivine Lens",
  "quest.1A000000000006CC.quest_desc": [
    "You have to find 9 Olivines"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006CC.title": "Olivine",
  "quest.1A000000000006CD.quest_desc": [
    "You may use a sifting machine to get it from purified olivine ore."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006CD.title": "Exquisite Olivine",
  "quest.1A000000000006CF.quest_desc": [
    "Use a cutting machine to make a plate from a block"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006CF.title": "Olivine Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000006D4.quest_desc": [
    "Copper + redstone (using an alloy smelter) to get a red alloy ingot. Then create a plate from it."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006D4.title": "Red Alloy Plate",
  "quest.1A000000000006E5.quest_desc": [
    "Use EV+ Chemical Reactor to make the tungsten trioxide dust from the tungstate or scheelite dust."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006E5.title": "Tungsten Trioxide Dust",
  "quest.1A000000000006E6.quest_desc": [
    "You can create it from plate by hammer. Note that this is the most easy and fast way, but completely not profitable. Use a NEI to find other recipes."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006E6.title": "Copper Item Casing",
  "quest.1A000000000006E7.quest_desc": [
    "Craft it from steel. Most profit way is to use extruder to get 2 rods from 1 ingot, then cut them by cutting machine to get 4 bolts per each rod. Then use lathe or file to get screws from bolts. Other way to get directly bolts from ingot is to user extruder with bolt shape."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006E7.title": "Steel Screw",
  "quest.1A000000000006E8.quest_desc": [
    "Most of stone is fine to create stone brick that are suitable to craft farm blocks from them."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006E8.title": "Stone Bricks",
  "quest.1A000000000006EA.quest_desc": [
    "A part of casing for pyrolyse oven."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006EA.title": "Iron Frame Box",
  "quest.1A000000000006ED.quest_desc": [
    "You may craft it from plate by hammer. But if you have MV (or better) extruder, you can use it  to make small gears directly from ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006ED.title": "Small Aluminium Gear",
  "quest.1A000000000006EE.quest_desc": [
    "Use file or lathe to make a rod from ingot. If you have MV+ tier extruder, it will be the best choose to produce any rods."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006EE.title": "Aluminium Rod",
  "quest.1A000000000006EF.quest_desc": [
    "A multiblock that allow you to smelt more than 1 item per operation. Depends on coils."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006EF.title": "Multi Smelter",
  "quest.1A000000000006F0.quest_desc": [
    "A multiblock that can fill empty space under himself with concrete."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006F0.title": "Concrete Backfiller",
  "quest.1A000000000006F1.quest_desc": [
    "A multiblock that can fill empty space under himself with concrete. Better than  common version."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006F1.title": "Advanced Concrete Backfiller",
  "quest.1A000000000006F2.quest_desc": [
    "Better than Large Bronze Boiler."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006F2.title": "Large Steel Boiler",
  "quest.1A000000000006F3.quest_desc": [
    "Better than Large Steel Boiler"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006F3.title": "Large Titanium Boiler",
  "quest.1A000000000006F4.quest_desc": [
    "Better than Large Titanium Boiler"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006F4.title": "Large Tungstensteel Boiler",
  "quest.1A000000000006F5.quest_desc": [
    "Filter Machine Casing needs for Cleanroom only if you want to build cleanroom larger than 3 by 3 blocks for base."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006F5.title": "Filter Machine Casing",
  "quest.1A000000000006F7.quest_desc": [
    "This is easy way to craft a small coil. Other way is to use nikel-zink ferrite bolt instead of steel bolt to get more coils."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006F7.title": "Small Coil - easy way",
  "quest.1A000000000006F9.quest_desc": [
    "Use a wiremil to craft it."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006F9.title": "Tungstensteel Wire",
  "quest.1A000000000006FA.quest_desc": [
    "Use an isolation for 8k+ eu/t wires type."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006FA.title": "Tungstensteel Cable",
  "quest.1A000000000006FB.quest_desc": [
    "An energy storage. It can take any voltage and give out MV voltage (128 eu/t)."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006FB.title": "CESU",
  "quest.1A000000000006FC.quest_desc": [
    "Super tool that can fix all issues for any your multiblock. You must have it!"
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006FC.title": "Duct Tape Ultimate",
  "quest.1A000000000006FD.quest_desc": [
    "Put 4 stacks of this stuff to semi-auto maintenance hatch to forgot about problems with this multiblock (at least for month)."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006FD.title": "Auto Repair Kit",
  "quest.1A000000000006FE.quest_desc": [
    "Use a wiremill to craft it from an ingot."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006FE.title": "Fine Soldering Alloy Wire",
  "quest.1A000000000006FF.quest_desc": [
    "Nice hatch that give you ability to put there a stack of Auto Repair Kit to automatically repair multiblock. But for each auto-repair one of the kit will be consumed."
  ],
  "quest.1A000000000006FF.title": "Semi-Auto Maintenance Hatch",
  "quest.1A00000000000700.quest_desc": [
    "This is  the best choose to completely forgot about any problems with your multiblock."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000700.title": "Auto Maintenance Hatch",
  "quest.1A00000000000703.quest_desc": [
    "Good way to rename ME interface. New name of renamed ME interface will be visible in ME terminal."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000703.title": "Quartz Cutting Knife",
  "quest.1A00000000000705.quest_desc": [
    "Currently you can only make 2 planks from 1 wood log by crafting. But later you may use cutting tools or machines to increase output result."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000705.title": "Wood Planks",
  "quest.1A0000000000070C.quest_desc": [
    "A stuff to create a red wire from Project Red mod."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000070C.title": "2x Red Alloy Wire",
  "quest.1A0000000000070E.quest_desc": [
    "No Description"
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000070E.title": "Energy Detector",
  "quest.1A0000000000070F.quest_desc": [
    "A part of Energy Detector."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000070F.title": "EU-Reader",
  "quest.1A00000000000711.quest_desc": [
    "A part of most IC Gates. You may create it from gold ingot via common furnace."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000711.title": "Gold Nugget",
  "quest.1A0000000000071E.quest_desc": [
    "If you found a horse it will be useful."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000071E.title": "Saddle",
  "quest.1A0000000000071F.quest_desc": [
    "Very useful chest. It can pull to himself dropped items near him and put them inside."
  ],
  "quest.1A0000000000071F.title": "Vacuum Chest",
  "quest.1A00000000000721.quest_desc": [
    "You have to craft any electric compressor between LV and IV tier."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000721.title": "Any Electric Compressor",
  "quest.1A00000000000723.quest_desc": [
    "Put Gallium and Arsenic ingots to EBF to get an alloy of them."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000723.title": "Gallium Arsenide Ingot",
  "quest.1A00000000000726.quest_desc": [
    "Can be crafted from a rubber ingot with help of lathe."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000726.title": "Rubber Rod",
  "quest.1A00000000000727.quest_desc": [
    "You can craft it from molten rubber."
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000727.title": "Rubber Bar",
  "quest.1A00000000000729.quest_desc": [
    "Use an electrolyzer to get a sodium from Salt"
  ],
  "quest.1A00000000000729.title": "Sodium Dust",
  "quest.1A0000000000072A.quest_desc": [
    "You may use HV+ macerator to get a tiny dust of tungsten."
  ],
